	(text_box "Battery Input\n\nUse a footprint with a pad AND large plated holes\n\nFor intial testing, will solder a screw terminal block\n\nFor final prototype, will solder 16 AWG wire (for PowerPole)\n\nE: new addition, using 10 AWG wire with studs and the LCA10-10-L CONN TERM RECT TONG 10 AWG #10 connection"
